<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1>Hi {{ userName }} !</h1>
    <p>Remember that tomorrow you've got an event:</p>

    <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <h2>{{ eventName }}</h2>
        <p>📅 {{ eventDate }}</p>
        <p>📍 {{ eventLocation }}</p>
    </div>

    <p>Don't be late!</p>
</div>